        "question": "下面 count_triple 函数的时间复杂度为（　）。\nint count_triple(int n) {\n    int cnt = 0;\n    for (int a = 1; a <= n; a++)\n        for (int b = a; a + b <= n; b++) {\n            int c = sqrt(a*a + b*b);\n            if (a + b + c > n) break;\n            if (a*a + b*b == c*c) cnt++;\n        }\n    return cnt;\n}",
